amplab-extras/SparkR-pkg/blob/master/pkg/R/RDD.R#L101</a><br> <a href=\"https://github.com/amplab-extras/SparkR-pkg/blob/master/pkg/R/RDD.R#L105\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/amplab-extras/SparkR-pkg/blob/master/pkg/R/RDD.R%23L105&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241017782000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Z_pCvBFqcmY-br0SIQaDy\">https://github.com/amplab-extras/SparkR-pkg/blob/master/pkg/R/RDD.R#L105</a></p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">are two examples.</p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">We should investigate if this is required and if not, we should remove it as it adds more overhead.</p> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:10px 0 10px 24px;vertical-align:middle;padding-left:0\"> \r\n                                            <table align=\"left\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                                                <tr> \r\n                                                    <td style=\"padding:0